abstract: >-
  High-performance explicit cylindrical MHD / QMHD driver for plasma cosmology.
  Features staggered constrained transport, production UCT+Hall EMF kernels,
  cylindrical HLLD solvers, G₂ entropy geometry, and gyrotropic kinetic closures.
